# PandaAI Workflow Audit Skill

When the user provides a PandaAI exported workflow JSON (or a saved `GET /api/workflow/query` response) and asks whether it is overfit, credible, defective, or how to improve it, use the local skill package.

Preferred local project path:

```text
.cursor/skills/pandaai-workflow-audit
```

Workflow:

1. Read `.cursor/skills/pandaai-workflow-audit/SKILL.md` and follow its Core workflow exactly.
2. Run `scripts/audit_workflow.py` on the provided workflow file; never execute embedded workflow code.
3. Load files under `references/` only when the skill asks for them or the case needs those details.
4. Verify critical and high findings against the source JSON before presenting them.
5. Reproduce the disclaimer from `references/disclaimer_template.md` verbatim; never call a workflow safe or proven profitable.
